---
// Final CTA Section
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--color-primary)] via-[#009d93] to-[#007f77]" id="cta-final">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute -right-20 top-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-white/15 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -left-12 bottom-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-white/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(255,255,255,0.18),_rgba(0,0,0,0)_55%)]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-20 text-white sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-center">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">¿List@ para sentirte segura cada vez que sonríes?</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-base text-white/85">
          Reserva tu valoración empática y recibe un plan personalizado con tiempos, inversión y recomendaciones claras. Creamos un espacio de confianza donde puedes expresar tus miedos sin ser juzgada.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-3xl gap-3 text-left text-sm text-white/90 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-white" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 12l-2-2" />
            <path d="M8.5 11.5l3.5-3.5" />
            <path d="M10 18a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16Z" />
          </svg>
          Valoración 1 a 1 con diagnóstico digital en 45 minutos.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-white" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 12l-2-2" />
            <path d="M8.5 11.5l3.5-3.5" />
            <path d="M10 18a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16Z" />
          </svg>
          Plan con inversión, tiempos y alternativas de financiación.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-white" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 12l-2-2" />
            <path d="M8.5 11.5l3.5-3.5" />
            <path d="M10 18a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16Z" />
          </svg>
          Acompañamiento por WhatsApp antes y después de tu cita.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] shadow-[0_25px_60px_-30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white/90"
        >
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 5v10" />
            <path d="M7 10h10" />
          </svg>
          Agenda tu valoración empática
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/573102608676"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-white/70 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white/10"
        >
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347Zm-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 0 1-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 0 1-1.51-5.26C2.167 5.743 6.602 1.309 12.054 1.309c2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 0 1 2.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884Z" />
          </svg>
          Habla con Mariana por WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/70">Agenda limitada por semana · Reserva con anticipación</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
